      "original_position": 16,
      "content": "Okay, so the gitee-agent-skills repo was cloned successfully. The skills are nested inside `skills/gitee-agent-skills/skills/`. For OpenClaw to recognize them, I need to move each skill directory up to `/workspace/skills/` directly.\n\nLet me move all the individual skills to the proper location:"
