      "content": "All 13 Gitee Agent Skills have been installed. Let me verify one of them has the proper structure:"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_a55496da173c:msg_37",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 965,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 37,
      "original_position": 18,
      "content": "✅ **Gitee Agent Skills 已安装完成！**\n\n成功安装了 13 个 Gitee 相关的 Agent Skills：\n\n| Skill | 功能 |\n|-------|------|\n| `close-issue-flow` | 关闭 Issue 流程 |\n| `create-issue` | 创建 Issue |\n| `create-pr` | 创建 Pull Request |\n| `create-release` | 创建 Release |\n| `daily-digest` | 每日摘要 |\n| `implement-issue` | 实现 Issue |\n| `merge-pr-check` | 合并 PR 检查 |\n| `quick-fix-suggestion` | 快速修复建议 |\n| `repo-explorer` | 仓库探索器 |\n| `review-pr` | 代码评审 PR |\n| `search-and-fork` | 搜索并 Fork |\n| `search-repos` | 搜索仓库 |\n| `stale-pr-reminder` | 过期 PR 提醒 |\n| `triage-issues` | Issue 分类 |\n\n这些技能需要配置 **Gitee MCP Server** 才能使用。如果你需要配置 MCP 服务，可以使用 `mcp-builder` 技能来设置。\n\n有什么想先用这些技能做的吗？"
    }
  ],
